# ioBroker.autodoc — branches: default **`dev`**

- For **normal changes** (code, CI, docs, scripts): **`git checkout dev`**, commit there, **`git push origin dev`**. Prefer reconciling **`main → dev`** (merge/fast-forward after release) instead of committing directly on **`main`**.
- **`main`** is reserved for **`npm run release`**, versioning, and the maintainer flow in **`CONTRIBUTING`** / **`release-order.mdc`**. Agents should not routinely land non-release work **only** on **`main`**.
- Explicit **exceptions** ( Maintainer says hotfix **`main`**-only): follow Maintainer instructions while keeping **`dev`** aligned afterward (**merge `origin/main`** into **`dev`**, **`git push origin dev`**).
